ronunciation":["반지"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/6183c118688cfa624404.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24041-1-8-2","ko":"이거, 은으로 된 반지야.","zh":"这个啊，是用银子制成的戒指哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거,","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}},{"text":"은으로","meaning":"银","explanation":"은：银；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"은","audio":"/audio/3864f4b8f6e19d42fbca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24041","senseId":"1","lemma":"은","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"은으로","audio":"/audio/e11b2e8f2d32d640fc63.mp3"}},{"text":"된","meaning":"做成，用……做","explanation":"되다：做成，用……做；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"9","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된","audio":"/audio/1c4305152ccc1be2241e.mp3"}},{"text":"반지야.","meaning":"戒指","explanation":"반지：戒指；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"반지","audio":"/audio/f1e02439b018ae91a9e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57661"